{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":199590,"duration_api_ms":241646,"num_turns":17,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a17bf654-4f53-48ea-b76d-a8cba55092f9","total_cost_usd":1.178696,"usage":{"input_tokens":1667,"cache_creation_input_tokens":82433,"cache_read_input_tokens":657732,"output_tokens":8343,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":82433,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1667,"outputTokens":8343,"cacheReadInputTokens":657732,"cacheCreationInputTokens":82433,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.06098225,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":64,"outputTokens":7016,"cacheReadInputTokens":188535,"cacheCreationInputTokens":50973,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.11771375,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 183 tests pass across 23 test binaries in tank_core with 0 failures, 0 ignored","All 18 budget tracking tests pass: test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools, test_total_c_helper_sums_all_pools, test_budget_component_labels_cover_all_element_bearing_fields, test_budget_path_rules_catch_convention_based_future_fields, test_closed_system_n_conservation, test_closed_system_c_conservation, test_periphyton_capacity_excess_routes_to_fine_detritus, test_algae_loss_routing_is_clamped_to_available_biomass_and_stays_particulate, test_plant_loss_routing_is_clamped_to_available_biomass_and_stays_particulate, test_trim_plants_preserves_n_and_c_when_routed_to_detritus, test_clean_filter_routes_removed_microbes_to_dissolved_organics, test_closed_system_shrimp_mortality_conserves_n_and_c, test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c, test_water_change_n_export_tracked, test_water_change_tracks_gross_n_import_and_export, test_dissolved_oxygen_stage_tracks_gross_in_and_out, test_preset_dic_exchange_is_explicitly_tracked_without_disabling_carbon_guard, test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled","cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings passes with zero warnings","cargo fmt --all -- --check passes with no formatting issues","Acceptance criterion 1 (inspect per-tick deltas): BudgetLedger stores TickBudgetRecord with per-stage BudgetEntry deltas; tests inspect individual entries by label and verify in_mg/out_mg values","Acceptance criterion 2 (closed-system near-zero net delta): test_closed_system_n_conservation and test_closed_system_c_conservation run 24 ticks with active biology (non-zero algae, microbes, microfauna, detritus) and assert per-tick net deltas < 1e-6","Acceptance criterion 3 (zero-cost when disabled): budget_ledger is Option<BudgetLedger> (engine.rs:27), defaults to None, maybe_record_stage (engine.rs:250-269) only computes BudgetSnapshot when tick.is_some(). Verified by test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled","Canonical total_nitrogen_mg (budget.rs:349-354) sums 17 N-bearing components including substrate_layers[*].nutrient_store_mg_n_total per reviewer correction. Canonical total_carbon_mg (budget.rs:356-361) sums 14 C-bearing components. Both are single canonical sources of truth built by summing BudgetComponent arrays","TankState exposes total_nitrogen(), total_carbon(), budget_totals() (state.rs:241-251) all delegating to BudgetTotals::from_state() — single canonical definition point","Runtime conservation guard (engine.rs:524-549) returns SimError::BudgetImbalance for closed-system ticks exceeding 1e-6 tolerance. Uses residual-based carbon subtraction for known chemistry DIC exchange. entry_has_open_action_flux requires both matching label AND non-zero per-element flux","Amendment fr-8-37900497 IMPLEMENTED: is_animal_mass_budget_path (budget_tracking.rs:244-248) uses convention-based discovery: path.starts_with('animal.') && path.ends_with('_count') && path != 'animal.berried_females_count'. AnimalState has doc comments on count fields documenting implicit mass convention","Amendment fr-8-1415e3ec IMPLEMENTED: water_change.rs lines 60-62 have comment explaining dissolved_feed_residue_g_total *= retention is a shadow counter bookkeeping adjustment that must stay out of the explicit budget delta","Amendment fr-8-2fe7314b IMPLEMENTED: test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools and test_total_c_helper_sums_all_pools now compute particulate_organics_g_total and fine_detritus_g_total separately through individual manual_organic_nitrogen_mg/manual_organic_carbon_mg calls","Amendment fr-8-8959bb9b IMPLEMENTED: plant_growth.rs uses route_plant_loss_to_fine_detritus (line 159) routing respiration+senescence to fine_detritus_g_total. algae_growth.rs uses route_algae_loss_to_fine_detritus (lines 124, 209) routing respiration+grazing to fine_detritus_g_total. Neither path dissolves biomass directly into DOC/DON anymore","Amendment fr-8-65a8127d correctly NOT implemented: fund_live_shrimp_biomass (shrimp.rs:636-648) only checks animal.reserve_g and returns false if insufficient — no water-column fallback exists. The described issue was factually incorrect","Per-stage granular recording covers all 12 PlayerAction variants via exhaustive match in action_budget_label plus all hourly and daily system stages","Structural coverage guard (budget_tracking.rs:327-362) serializes TankState to JSON, discovers numeric paths by convention, and asserts exact equality with canonical helper component labels. Declaration-site doc comments (budget.rs:162-169, 260-267) document the naming-convention obligation","All 6 acceptance-criteria tests from reviewer comments are present and passing: (1) test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools, (2) test_total_c_helper_sums_all_pools, (3) test_closed_system_n_conservation, (4) test_closed_system_c_conservation, (5) test_water_change_n_export_tracked, (6) test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled"],"findings_or_gaps":["The convention-based field discovery (is_nitrogen_budget_path/is_carbon_budget_path) catches *_mg_n_total, *_mg_c_total, *biomass_g, *_count under animal.*, and shared detritus patterns. A future element-bearing field with a non-standard suffix would evade detection. This is documented in declaration-site comments and is an acceptable known limitation given Rust's lack of compile-time field introspection.","Shrimp eggs remain implicit (EggCohort has count and progress_days only). Mass is conserved because fund_live_shrimp_biomass debits reserve_g for hatching and maturation. A first-class egg biomass pool would provide clearer save-schema semantics but is appropriately deferred.","Plant/algae 'respiration' losses are now routed to fine_detritus_g_total rather than to DIC/O2. The amendment fr-8-8959bb9b offered two options ('route respiration to DIC/O2, or route turnover/senescence to detritus') and the detritus option was chosen. This means the daily respiration parameter acts as particulate turnover rather than true metabolic respiration. If a future phase models literal O2 consumption and CO2 production from plant/algae respiration, those parameter names and this routing would need revisiting.","The round 9 plan_and_implement outstanding_risks note claims 'fund_live_shrimp_biomass still uses reserve first and dissolved pools as fallback' but this is inaccurate — the current code at fund_live_shrimp_biomass (shrimp.rs:636-648) uses reserve_g only with no dissolved-pool fallback. This is a stale documentation artifact, not a code issue.","Complex multi-process stages like nitrogen_cycle record budgets via snapshot-derived gross component deltas. Same-component turnover within a single stage pass can net out. The explicit-budget path addresses the most important bidirectional stages (water_change, dissolved_oxygen, chemistry). Acceptable granularity for this phase.","Oxygen tracking is limited to dissolved_oxygen_mg_total and does not decompose O2 across biomass pools. Consistent with the deliverable's 'track where feasible' wording."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ccb62fa3-5d98-4235-a3b3-280c27bbfd6f"}
